  "note": "Registry of public transit feeds used by the TRANSIT layer: metro, light rail, tram and bus networks whose operators publish live vehicle data openly for riders. Nothing here is scraped or private. kind: 'positions' = live vehicle coordinates; 'arrivals' = live arrival predictions, where the vehicle is drawn at the stop it is next due at because the feed publishes no vehicle coordinates. mode: rail | bus | tram, which picks the marker and the default colour. Attribution strings are rendered in the UI and must be kept. 'station' = the operator publishes which station a train is at and no coordinates at all; the train is drawn at that station's coordinate from a bundled station list.",
